WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:00.367
News.

00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:00.734
Russian

00:00:00.734 --> 00:00:01.368
authorities are

00:00:01.368 --> 00:00:02.635
telling vulgar fighters

00:00:02.635 --> 00:00:04.471
not to follow their leader,

00:00:04.471 --> 00:00:05.372
Evgeny Prigozhin,

00:00:05.372 --> 00:00:07.941
and also to take measures to detain him.

00:00:08.141 --> 00:00:08.742
That coming

00:00:08.742 --> 00:00:09.743
as the infamous head

00:00:09.743 --> 00:00:11.077
of the private Wagner

00:00:11.077 --> 00:00:12.545
Russian mercenary army

00:00:12.545 --> 00:00:14.748
is making a stunning claim tonight,

00:00:14.748 --> 00:00:16.282
accusing Russia's military

00:00:16.282 --> 00:00:17.517
leadership of killing

00:00:17.517 --> 00:00:18.018
a, quote,

00:00:18.018 --> 00:00:20.320
huge amount of his Wagner

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:21.521
forces in a strike.

00:00:21.521 --> 00:00:24.024
That is a claim that Russia denies.

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:25.258
We have CNN's Ben

00:00:25.258 --> 00:00:26.893
Wedeman on the ground in Ukraine

00:00:26.893 --> 00:00:27.460
and our Oren

00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:28.461
Liebermann monitoring

00:00:28.461 --> 00:00:29.529
at the Pentagon Ben,

00:00:29.529 --> 00:00:30.563
I want to go to you first.

00:00:30.563 --> 00:00:32.165
What can you tell us about this

00:00:32.165 --> 00:00:33.333
claim from Prigozhin

00:00:33.333 --> 00:00:37.170
and how Moscow is responding tonight?

00:00:38.405 --> 00:00:39.539
Well, actually, Alex, that's

00:00:39.539 --> 00:00:42.542
just one of many claims made by Prigozhin

00:00:43.410 --> 00:00:43.810
today

00:00:43.810 --> 00:00:45.045
that's clearly going

00:00:45.045 --> 00:00:46.112
to get him in trouble.

00:00:46.112 --> 00:00:48.948
He started the day with a video interview

00:00:48.948 --> 00:00:49.716
in which he claimed

00:00:49.716 --> 00:00:51.751
that Russia had no pretext

00:00:52.285 --> 00:00:54.654
for invading Ukraine last year.

00:00:54.821 --> 00:00:57.223
Then he went on to make this claim

00:00:57.223 --> 00:00:59.959
that the Russian military leadership,

00:00:59.959 --> 00:01:01.394
without specifying who

00:01:01.394 --> 00:01:04.397
or what exactly attacked Wagner

00:01:04.397 --> 00:01:07.434
base, killing dozens of his mercenaries.

00:01:07.467 --> 00:01:09.702
Now, it's not clear where that base is.

00:01:09.702 --> 00:01:11.671
Some video is circulating

00:01:11.671 --> 00:01:13.773
in social media of that base.

00:01:14.040 --> 00:01:15.141
The Russian Defense

00:01:15.141 --> 00:01:16.443
Ministry has said

00:01:16.443 --> 00:01:18.978
that this is simply not true.

00:01:19.546 --> 00:01:22.515
The Russian media, Russian state media

00:01:22.515 --> 00:01:24.017
is saying that President Putin

00:01:24.017 --> 00:01:25.652
is being kept aware

00:01:25.652 --> 00:01:28.021
of these claims by Wagner

00:01:28.021 --> 00:01:30.156
and the situation in general.

00:01:30.156 --> 00:01:30.924
And that, quote,

00:01:30.924 --> 00:01:34.194
all necessary measures are being taken.

00:01:34.194 --> 00:01:36.429
Now, Prigozhin went on to say

00:01:36.429 --> 00:01:38.698
that the evil being carried out

00:01:38.698 --> 00:01:40.900
by the Russian military leadership

00:01:41.134 --> 00:01:42.302
must be stopped.

00:01:42.302 --> 00:01:44.003
Now, many people are taking this

00:01:44.003 --> 00:01:47.040
as a call for a coup although Prigozhin

00:01:47.040 --> 00:01:50.009
went out, came out later and denied it.

00:01:50.210 --> 00:01:52.979
Now, as a result of this obvious

00:01:52.979 --> 00:01:55.415
shock of instability in Russia,

00:01:55.682 --> 00:01:57.917
there are reports on social media

00:01:57.917 --> 00:01:59.285
that military vehicles

00:01:59.285 --> 00:02:00.720
have been seen outside

00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:01.387
the State

00:02:01.387 --> 00:02:02.989
Duma and Moscow,

00:02:02.989 --> 00:02:05.525
as well as in the city of Rostov.

00:02:05.625 --> 00:02:08.161
Russian city to the east of here.

00:02:08.161 --> 00:02:11.698
Now, in reaction to Prigozhin

00:02:11.731 --> 00:02:13.666
statements, the FSB,

00:02:13.666 --> 00:02:15.702
the Russian Federal Security Service,

00:02:15.969 --> 00:02:16.836
has announced

00:02:16.836 --> 00:02:17.971
that it has begun

00:02:17.971 --> 00:02:20.373
criminal proceedings against Prigozhin

00:02:20.607 --> 00:02:22.242
for organizing armed

00:02:22.242 --> 00:02:23.943
and armed insurrection.

00:02:23.943 --> 00:02:26.212
And this is according to the statement

00:02:26.212 --> 00:02:28.381
from the SS FSB.

00:02:28.381 --> 00:02:32.585
Punishable by 12 to 20 years in prison.

00:02:32.652 --> 00:02:33.586
Now, the Ukrainians

00:02:33.586 --> 00:02:35.355
are obviously watching this

00:02:35.355 --> 00:02:37.257
with intense interest.

00:02:37.257 --> 00:02:37.423
Now,

00:02:37.423 --> 00:02:38.858
we did see a tweet from

00:02:38.858 --> 00:02:41.394
the Ukrainian Defense Ministry

00:02:41.394 --> 00:02:44.497
simply saying we are watching

00:02:45.165 --> 00:02:45.698
Alex, there

00:02:45.698 --> 00:02:46.866
certainly is an earthquake

00:02:46.866 --> 00:02:48.701
in Russia's war in Ukraine.

00:02:48.701 --> 00:02:50.703
Ben Wedeman, thank you very much.

00:02:50.703 --> 00:02:52.672
We have new reporting now on the U.S.

00:02:52.672 --> 00:02:54.440
reaction to this showdown

00:02:54.440 --> 00:02:56.442
between Russia and the Volgograd

00:02:56.442 --> 00:02:57.177
mercenary group.

00:02:57.177 --> 00:02:57.911
Here's our Pentagon

00:02:57.911 --> 00:02:59.679
correspondent, Oren Liebermann.

00:02:59.679 --> 00:03:01.614
Oren, what are you being told?

00:03:01.614 --> 00:03:02.215
Alec, certainly

00:03:02.215 --> 00:03:02.749
after Ben

00:03:02.749 --> 00:03:03.383
laid it all out

00:03:03.383 --> 00:03:04.384
like that, the friction

00:03:04.384 --> 00:03:05.785
we're seeing between Prigozhin

00:03:05.785 --> 00:03:07.687
and the Russian military leadership,

00:03:07.687 --> 00:03:09.689
it's easy to see why US officials

00:03:09.689 --> 00:03:11.191
are watching this so closely

00:03:11.191 --> 00:03:12.992
and are tracking this so closely

00:03:12.992 --> 00:03:14.761
to see how this develops.

00:03:14.761 --> 00:03:15.895
The US has watched

00:03:15.895 --> 00:03:17.330
and we have watched friction

00:03:17.330 --> 00:03:19.098
between the two in the past,

00:03:19.098 --> 00:03:21.100
threats coming from Prigozhin aimed

00:03:21.301 --> 00:03:22.468
either at the Russian military

00:03:22.468 --> 00:03:23.536
or its leadership

00:03:23.536 --> 00:03:25.205
Defense Minister Sergei Shoigu

00:03:25.205 --> 00:03:26.472
or the Chief of General Staff,

00:03:26.472 --> 00:03:27.640
Valery Gerasimov.

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:28.341
But one U.S.

00:03:28.341 --> 00:03:30.376
official tells us there is a sense here

00:03:30.376 --> 00:03:32.145
that this goes above and beyond that

00:03:32.145 --> 00:03:34.147
this isn't the usual rhetoric.

00:03:34.147 --> 00:03:35.915
There is something different here.

00:03:35.915 --> 00:03:36.516
There is something

00:03:36.516 --> 00:03:38.251
perhaps more escalatory here.

00:03:38.251 --> 00:03:39.219
And that's one of the reasons

00:03:39.219 --> 00:03:41.221
the US is watching this so closely

00:03:41.221 --> 00:03:42.989
to see how this develops

00:03:42.989 --> 00:03:44.924
over the course of the next several hours

00:03:44.924 --> 00:03:45.658
and days.

00:03:45.658 --> 00:03:46.459
It's also worth

00:03:46.459 --> 00:03:47.060
pointing out

00:03:47.060 --> 00:03:49.529
that Prigozhin has normally attacked

00:03:49.529 --> 00:03:50.530
Russian military leadership

00:03:50.530 --> 00:03:51.831
following some Ukrainian

00:03:51.831 --> 00:03:53.233
battlefield success

00:03:53.233 --> 00:03:55.401
or breakthrough or tactical success.

00:03:55.568 --> 00:03:56.536
And it doesn't appear

00:03:56.536 --> 00:03:57.904
to be the case here.

00:03:57.904 --> 00:03:59.672
There doesn't appear to have been

00:03:59.672 --> 00:04:00.106
some sort

00:04:00.106 --> 00:04:01.140
of Ukrainian success

00:04:01.140 --> 00:04:02.508
that that precipitated

00:04:02.508 --> 00:04:04.377
these sudden threats by Prigozhin.

00:04:04.377 --> 00:04:06.279
And yet we have seen this friction

00:04:06.279 --> 00:04:07.280
with what appears to be

00:04:07.280 --> 00:04:08.881
an increasing frequency.

00:04:08.881 --> 00:04:09.349
In fact,

00:04:09.349 --> 00:04:10.783
just early last week,

00:04:10.783 --> 00:04:12.151
Russia's Ministry of Defense

00:04:12.151 --> 00:04:13.753
said that private contractors,

00:04:13.753 --> 00:04:14.921
military contractors,

00:04:14.921 --> 00:04:16.589
would have to sign contracts

00:04:16.589 --> 00:04:17.924
to try to bring them in line

00:04:17.924 --> 00:04:19.959
with Russian military leadership

00:04:20.193 --> 00:04:21.761
and the Russian military itself.

00:04:21.761 --> 00:04:22.862
And it was Prigozhin

00:04:22.862 --> 00:04:23.429
who said that

00:04:23.429 --> 00:04:25.465
Wagner would not be doing that.

00:04:25.531 --> 00:04:26.566
And so you see that

00:04:26.566 --> 00:04:27.734
leading into this friction here

00:04:27.734 --> 00:04:29.769
as the U.S. watches this, Alex. The U.S.

00:04:29.769 --> 00:04:31.204
and certainly the rest of Netto

00:04:31.204 --> 00:04:31.804
are going to be watching

00:04:31.804 --> 00:04:33.139
this very very closely.

00:04:33.139 --> 00:04:34.107
Oren Liebermann at the Pentagon,

00:04:34.107 --> 00:04:34.941
thanks very much.

00:04:34.941 --> 00:04:35.341
Let's get more

00:04:35.341 --> 00:04:38.011
now with our military and Russia experts,

00:04:38.311 --> 00:04:39.412
Colonel Cedric

00:04:39.412 --> 00:04:40.546
Leighton and Dmitri Alperovitch.

00:04:40.546 --> 00:04:41.481
Thank you both for joining me.

00:04:41.481 --> 00:04:42.815
Dmitri, I want to go to you first.

00:04:42.815 --> 00:04:44.050
You say that Prigozhin

00:04:44.050 --> 00:04:45.685
massively overreached.

00:04:45.685 --> 00:04:47.854
You're comparing this to gang warfare.

00:04:48.354 --> 00:04:49.822
This is very different

00:04:49.822 --> 00:04:52.158
than what Prigozhin has said before.

00:04:52.425 --> 00:04:53.793
It is an escalation.

00:04:53.793 --> 00:04:54.694
What do you think is behind it?

00:04:56.763 --> 00:04:57.196
Well, what

00:04:57.196 --> 00:04:58.631
percussion has been doing it for months

00:04:58.631 --> 00:04:59.565
now is criticize.

00:04:59.565 --> 00:04:59.932
And, of course,

00:04:59.932 --> 00:05:01.601
the Ministry of Defense Minister

00:05:01.601 --> 00:05:02.735
Shoigu, Google

00:05:02.735 --> 00:05:03.636
chief of General Staff

00:05:03.636 --> 00:05:05.471
Gerasimov for being incompetent,

00:05:05.471 --> 00:05:06.873
trying to draw distinction

00:05:06.873 --> 00:05:08.308
between his own capable

00:05:08.308 --> 00:05:09.242
Wagner forces

00:05:09.242 --> 00:05:10.877
that were able to take back mud

00:05:10.877 --> 00:05:11.911
by destroying it,

00:05:11.911 --> 00:05:13.513
and the Russian military

00:05:13.513 --> 00:05:15.682
that has been suffering loss after loss.

00:05:15.682 --> 00:05:17.216
But what he couldn't do.

00:05:17.216 --> 00:05:19.319
And the big mistake that he made today

00:05:19.485 --> 00:05:21.487
is to go after the pretext for this war.

00:05:21.487 --> 00:05:23.156
When you announced that this war

00:05:23.156 --> 00:05:25.224
was launched under false pretenses.

00:05:25.258 --> 00:05:26.292
He blamed Shoigu for it.

00:05:26.292 --> 00:05:27.293
But everyone knows

00:05:27.293 --> 00:05:28.428
that Putin is the one

00:05:28.428 --> 00:05:29.996
that ultimately made the decision.

00:05:29.996 --> 00:05:31.597
And thus he gave the opening to

00:05:31.597 --> 00:05:33.700
for Shoigu and others

00:05:33.700 --> 00:05:35.501
that have hated him for a long time.

00:05:35.501 --> 00:05:36.869
In the Kremlin apparatus,

00:05:36.869 --> 00:05:39.105
as well as in the FSB to go after him.

00:05:39.105 --> 00:05:40.106
And Colonel Leighton,

00:05:40.106 --> 00:05:41.040
as Dimitri noted there,

00:05:41.040 --> 00:05:41.641
this is a few

00:05:41.641 --> 00:05:42.909
that has been brewing for quite

00:05:42.909 --> 00:05:44.177
some time.

00:05:44.177 --> 00:05:45.178
Production has been lobbying

00:05:45.178 --> 00:05:46.879
those bombs for four months.

00:05:46.879 --> 00:05:48.715
But how do you assess this claim

00:05:48.715 --> 00:05:49.315
that production

00:05:49.315 --> 00:05:50.683
made, that Russian forces,

00:05:50.683 --> 00:05:52.819
the Russian military, actually targeted

00:05:53.019 --> 00:05:55.321
and killed many Wagner mercenaries

00:05:55.321 --> 00:05:56.155
as production claimed?

00:05:57.824 --> 00:05:58.291
Yeah, Alex,

00:05:58.291 --> 00:05:58.891
that's a very

00:05:58.891 --> 00:06:01.127
inflammatory claim under almost

00:06:01.127 --> 00:06:02.829
any condition that you can imagine.

00:06:02.829 --> 00:06:03.963
So you know what?

00:06:03.963 --> 00:06:05.598
Prigozhin seems to be doing here

00:06:05.598 --> 00:06:06.866
is upping the ante.

00:06:06.866 --> 00:06:08.901
He's basically saying

00:06:08.901 --> 00:06:11.637
this, you know, this this area has gone

00:06:11.637 --> 00:06:14.374
way beyond what I've intended.

00:06:14.741 --> 00:06:16.209
It's gone way beyond

00:06:16.209 --> 00:06:18.678
what the Russian state should be doing.

00:06:18.678 --> 00:06:19.579
And the Russian state

00:06:19.579 --> 00:06:21.614
has killed its own people.

00:06:21.614 --> 00:06:24.250
So that is a very significant

00:06:24.550 --> 00:06:27.520
I think, departure from the messages

00:06:27.520 --> 00:06:29.355
that we've seen from Prigozhin before.

00:06:29.355 --> 00:06:30.990
It's much more virulent

00:06:30.990 --> 00:06:33.893
and much more a part of a campaign

00:06:34.093 --> 00:06:35.795
that seems to be

00:06:35.795 --> 00:06:36.696
designed to topple

00:06:36.696 --> 00:06:37.964
the Ministry of Defense,

00:06:37.964 --> 00:06:38.798
at the very least,

00:06:38.798 --> 00:06:40.466
possibly Putin himself.

00:06:40.466 --> 00:06:42.535
I don't think it will be successful.

00:06:42.535 --> 00:06:43.102
So, Colonel,

00:06:43.102 --> 00:06:44.170
what are you going to be watching for

00:06:44.170 --> 00:06:46.105
now as the FSB is calling on foreign

00:06:46.105 --> 00:06:47.740
fighters to detain Prigozhin

00:06:49.976 --> 00:06:51.077
Well, I'm going to be watching

00:06:51.077 --> 00:06:52.412
for exactly that, Alex.

00:06:52.412 --> 00:06:53.346
Whether or not

00:06:53.346 --> 00:06:54.347
the BAUCHNER forces

00:06:54.347 --> 00:06:55.982
remain loyal to Prigozhin

00:06:55.982 --> 00:06:58.251
or whether they switch allegiance

00:06:58.251 --> 00:07:00.553
to Putin and and Shoigu.

00:07:01.087 --> 00:07:01.888
We've had

00:07:01.888 --> 00:07:04.223
generals come up on social media

00:07:04.223 --> 00:07:05.725
that have urged

00:07:05.725 --> 00:07:08.428
the Wagner Group to actually disband

00:07:08.428 --> 00:07:10.329
and to actually

00:07:10.329 --> 00:07:12.498
detain, as you mentioned, Prigozhin.

00:07:12.698 --> 00:07:14.167
We've also had

00:07:14.167 --> 00:07:17.370
other members call for a calm

00:07:17.370 --> 00:07:18.337
in this situation.

00:07:18.337 --> 00:07:19.205
And, of course,

00:07:19.205 --> 00:07:21.240
the broadcasts on state television

00:07:21.240 --> 00:07:22.074
have been,

00:07:22.074 --> 00:07:23.943
I think, a very significant departure

00:07:23.943 --> 00:07:26.312
from what we normally seen

00:07:26.579 --> 00:07:28.381
when it comes to these kinds of spats.

00:07:28.381 --> 00:07:29.949
We'll be watching for

00:07:29.949 --> 00:07:31.684
these kinds of tensions to unfold

00:07:31.684 --> 00:07:33.453
and whether or not Prigozhin

00:07:33.453 --> 00:07:35.354
is a free man.

00:07:35.354 --> 00:07:36.656
Dimitri, same question to you.

00:07:36.656 --> 00:07:37.957
What do you expect the next moves to be

00:07:39.792 --> 00:07:40.092
Well, what

00:07:40.092 --> 00:07:40.560
you're seeing

00:07:40.560 --> 00:07:42.061
right now is armored vehicles

00:07:42.061 --> 00:07:42.695
being deployed

00:07:42.695 --> 00:07:43.863
on the streets of Moscow

00:07:43.863 --> 00:07:46.332
for the first time since the early 1990s.

00:07:46.866 --> 00:07:47.900
Out of fear, of course,

00:07:47.900 --> 00:07:49.969
that Wagner may have supporters

00:07:50.203 --> 00:07:52.171
that may help them orchestrate a coup.

00:07:52.171 --> 00:07:52.972
So Putin

00:07:52.972 --> 00:07:54.474
does not want to take any chances.

00:07:54.474 --> 00:07:55.308
He's deploying

00:07:55.308 --> 00:07:56.442
not just the FSB

00:07:56.442 --> 00:07:57.643
and the Russian military,

00:07:57.643 --> 00:07:58.711
but the Guardian

00:07:58.711 --> 00:07:59.946
the National Guard, effectively

00:07:59.946 --> 00:08:01.614
his pretorian guard,

00:08:01.614 --> 00:08:02.882
hundreds of thousands of men

00:08:02.882 --> 00:08:04.083
that have armor

00:08:04.083 --> 00:08:06.152
that are very loyal to him.

00:08:06.319 --> 00:08:07.687
So he's got the overwhelming

00:08:07.687 --> 00:08:08.488
advantage here.

00:08:08.488 --> 00:08:11.157
I don't expect that Prigozhin and Wagner

00:08:11.190 --> 00:08:12.358
would be successful here.

00:08:12.358 --> 00:08:13.159
I don't even expect

00:08:13.159 --> 00:08:15.027
that they would survive the weekend

00:08:15.027 --> 00:08:17.597
or at least remain free, man.

00:08:17.597 --> 00:08:19.198
But it's certainly interesting

00:08:19.198 --> 00:08:21.000
that Putin is very concerned,

00:08:21.000 --> 00:08:22.535
perhaps for the first time

00:08:22.535 --> 00:08:23.736
in his presidency,

00:08:23.736 --> 00:08:26.205
about a potential for a coup.

00:08:26.205 --> 00:08:26.906
Dmitri,

00:08:26.906 --> 00:08:28.908
have you seen fractures within Wagner?

00:08:28.908 --> 00:08:30.409
Would you expect Wagner fighters

00:08:30.409 --> 00:08:32.578
to heed that call to arrest Prigozhin

00:08:34.780 --> 00:08:35.348
I'm not sure if they

00:08:35.348 --> 00:08:35.915
would arrest him,

00:08:35.915 --> 00:08:36.349
but certainly

00:08:36.349 --> 00:08:38.518
if you're a Wagner personnel right now,

00:08:38.518 --> 00:08:39.719
the last thing you want to do

00:08:39.719 --> 00:08:40.686
is either be killed

00:08:40.686 --> 00:08:41.754
by the Russian military

00:08:41.754 --> 00:08:42.889
and the Russian Guardia

00:08:42.889 --> 00:08:44.390
or be arrested

00:08:44.390 --> 00:08:46.425
and then potentially be sent again

00:08:46.425 --> 00:08:47.293
to fight in Ukraine.

00:08:47.293 --> 00:08:49.195
Now is a conflict yet again.

00:08:49.195 --> 00:08:51.631
So not a lot of good choices for them.

00:08:52.365 --> 00:08:53.065
Most of them,

00:08:53.065 --> 00:08:53.733
I would expect,

00:08:53.733 --> 00:08:55.501
would probably try to disappear

00:08:55.501 --> 00:08:57.803
and try to get home.

00:08:57.803 --> 00:08:59.872
Colonel Leighton, do you agree with

00:09:00.006 --> 00:09:00.673
with Dmitri

00:09:00.673 --> 00:09:04.277
that precautions life is now at risk

00:09:04.277 --> 00:09:05.611
Absolutely, Alex.

00:09:05.611 --> 00:09:07.480
I think Dimitri's spot on in this

00:09:07.480 --> 00:09:08.114
in this case,

00:09:08.114 --> 00:09:09.515
because what you're looking at

00:09:09.515 --> 00:09:11.484
is not only a power play,

00:09:11.484 --> 00:09:12.752
but it seems to be a power

00:09:12.752 --> 00:09:14.387
play done by someone

00:09:14.387 --> 00:09:16.622
who is not quite ready

00:09:16.622 --> 00:09:17.757
in terms of the forces

00:09:17.757 --> 00:09:19.191
that he has at his disposal

00:09:19.191 --> 00:09:20.059
to actually mount

00:09:20.059 --> 00:09:21.661
a coup or other,

00:09:21.661 --> 00:09:21.928
you know,

00:09:21.928 --> 00:09:23.963
other type of action of that type

00:09:23.963 --> 00:09:25.398
So I don't think he'll be successful

00:09:25.398 --> 00:09:26.232
and I think

00:09:26.232 --> 00:09:28.501
that his demise may be coming up

00:09:28.501 --> 00:09:29.802
very shortly.

00:09:29.869 --> 00:09:32.338
And Dmitri, in terms of what could happen

00:09:32.505 --> 00:09:33.306
in the coming weeks,

00:09:33.306 --> 00:09:34.040
and days, we're in the middle

00:09:34.040 --> 00:09:34.907
of this counteroffensive.

00:09:34.907 --> 00:09:36.842
Putin has acknowledged challenges

00:09:36.842 --> 00:09:37.810
during this period.

00:09:37.810 --> 00:09:39.211
Do you think that these developments

00:09:39.211 --> 00:09:40.880
make it more difficult

00:09:40.880 --> 00:09:42.114
for Putin to

00:09:42.114 --> 00:09:43.649
to spin the realities

00:09:43.649 --> 00:09:45.451
of how his forces are doing on

00:09:45.451 --> 00:09:45.818
the ground?

00:09:47.887 --> 00:09:48.721
I don't think so.

00:09:48.721 --> 00:09:52.592
I think he can present this as a rogue

00:09:52.758 --> 00:09:55.261
paramilitary, a contractor, Prigozhin,

00:09:55.828 --> 00:09:57.363
that is trying to actually

00:09:57.363 --> 00:09:58.230
not even orchestrate

00:09:58.230 --> 00:09:59.365
a coup against Putin.

00:09:59.365 --> 00:10:00.566
He's been very careful

00:10:00.566 --> 00:10:02.635
to promote his support of Putin.

00:10:02.868 --> 00:10:03.369
He's saying

00:10:03.369 --> 00:10:04.904
that he wants to clean the

00:10:04.904 --> 00:10:05.671
Russian military

00:10:05.671 --> 00:10:09.542
and the general staff of the traitors

00:10:09.542 --> 00:10:10.042
that he caught,

00:10:10.042 --> 00:10:11.143
as he calls them, that

00:10:11.143 --> 00:10:12.278
that are just destroying

00:10:12.278 --> 00:10:14.180
the Russian military in Ukraine.

00:10:14.180 --> 00:10:14.914
And he doesn't necessarily

00:10:14.914 --> 00:10:15.715
want to stop the war.

00:10:15.715 --> 00:10:17.249
He just thinks that he can prosecute

00:10:17.249 --> 00:10:17.984
it better.

00:10:17.984 --> 00:10:20.953
But look, Alex, the way you orchestrate

00:10:20.953 --> 00:10:21.954
successful coups

00:10:21.954 --> 00:10:24.023
is not by announcing them far in advance,

00:10:24.256 --> 00:10:25.458
especially against the state

00:10:25.458 --> 00:10:26.492
that controls

00:10:26.492 --> 00:10:27.526
the military, controls

00:10:27.526 --> 00:10:28.561
the security services,

00:10:28.561 --> 00:10:30.363
has enormous firepower.

00:10:30.363 --> 00:10:31.430
You try to do it quietly

00:10:31.430 --> 00:10:32.164
and then announce

00:10:32.164 --> 00:10:33.232
that you've been successful.

00:10:33.232 --> 00:10:34.667
So Prigozhin is doing this

00:10:34.667 --> 00:10:35.935
completely backwards,

00:10:35.935 --> 00:10:38.037
and that's why he's very likely to fail.

00:10:38.037 --> 00:10:38.371
All right.

00:10:38.371 --> 00:10:38.671
Well, thank you

00:10:38.671 --> 00:10:40.506
both for joining me to break down

00:10:40.506 --> 00:10:41.907
these stunning development

00:10:41.907 --> 00:10:42.642
Colonel Cedric Leighton,

00:10:42.642 --> 00:10:44.677
Dmitri Alperovitch, thanks to you both.

